sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Client as User / API client
participant API as API service
participant StationsController
participant StationService as List station services
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
participant MeasurementsController
participant QueryMeasurementsService
participant MeasurementRepository as IMeasurementRepository / MongoMeasurementRepository
participant Mongo as MongoDB Atlas

alt search weather stations
  Client->>API: GET /weather-stations?name=central
  API->>StationsController: route with JWT user
  StationsController->>StationService: execute({ ownerId, name })
  StationService->>StationRepository: findByOwnerId(ownerId, { name })
  StationRepository->>Mongo: query weather_stations by owner and partial name
  Mongo-->>StationRepository: matching stations
  StationRepository-->>StationService: WeatherStation[]
  StationService-->>StationsController: stations
  StationsController-->>Client: 200 StationResponse[]
else search available stations
  Client->>API: GET /weather-stations/available?name=central
  API->>StationsController: route with JWT user
  StationsController->>StationService: execute({ name })
  StationService->>StationRepository: findAll({ name })
  StationRepository->>Mongo: query weather_stations by partial name
  Mongo-->>StationRepository: matching stations
  StationRepository-->>StationService: WeatherStation[]
  StationService-->>StationsController: stations
  StationsController-->>Client: 200 StationResponse[]
else filter measurements
  Client->>API: GET /measurements?stationName&tempMin&tempMax&humidityMin&humidityMax&pressureMin&pressureMax&reportedFrom&reportedTo&alertOnly
  API->>MeasurementsController: route with normalized query params
  MeasurementsController->>QueryMeasurementsService: execute(filters)
  QueryMeasurementsService->>QueryMeasurementsService: validate numeric and date ranges
  QueryMeasurementsService->>MeasurementRepository: findWithFilters(normalizedFilters)
  alt stationName filter present
    MeasurementRepository->>Mongo: resolve matching station IDs from station names
  end
  MeasurementRepository->>Mongo: query measurements by station IDs, ranges, dates, alert state
  Mongo-->>MeasurementRepository: matching measurements
  MeasurementRepository-->>QueryMeasurementsService: Measurement[]
  QueryMeasurementsService-->>MeasurementsController: measurements
  MeasurementsController-->>Client: 200 MeasurementResponse[]
end
